title: pickup_prompt
---
<<declare $pickup_success = true as bool>>
Pick up [important]{$item_name}[/important]?
-> Yes
    <<try_pickup>>
    <<jump pickup_result>>
-> No
===

title: pickup_result
---
<<if $pickup_success>>
[important]{$item_name}[/important] picked up.
-> Ok
<<else>>
There's no room for [important]{$item_name}[/important].
-> Ok
<<endif>>
===
